<node id="key:T1"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">How did a hurricane turn into five weeks without safe tap water?</data></node>
<node id="key:T2"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Whose fuel fouled the air station's generator?</data></node>
<node id="key:T3"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Are the debris contractor and the fuel supplier connected?</data></node>
<node id="key:T4"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Who took over 410 aid accounts, and was it planned?</data></node>
<node id="key:T5"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Did every neighborhood get the same help?</data></node>
<node id="key:T6"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Why did two moored tankers spill 9,000 barrels as the storm arrived?</data></node>
<node id="key:T7"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Was the channel blast an accident?</data></node>
<node id="key:T11"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Does the aerial imagery agree with the utility's account of the outages?</data></node>
<node id="key:T12"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">What did the port's own sensors see?</data></node>
<node id="key:T13"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">What does the 911 record say about the storm, hour by hour?</data></node>
<node id="key:T14"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">How late were the Spanish-language warnings, and did it matter?</data></node>
<node id="key:T15"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Were the rumors organic?</data></node>
<node id="key:T16"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">What pushed the hospitals past capacity twice?</data></node>
<node id="key:T17"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Who was rescued, where, and by whom?</data></node>
<node id="key:T19"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Who was flying drones over the substation and the docks before the storm?</data></node>
<node id="key:T20"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Where did the oil go, and who breathed it?</data></node>
<node id="key:T21"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Did every alert reach every station?</data></node>
<node id="key:T22"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Which storm claims were never real?</data></node>
<node id="key:T8"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Why did parts of the city lose power again after the storm?</data></node>
<node id="key:T9"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">Why did Districts 3 and 4 lose water pressure two weeks after the storm?</data></node>
<node id="key:T10"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">How did the intrusion stay hidden for six weeks?</data></node>
<node id="key:T18"><data key="type">AnswerKeyPath</data><data key="label">What did the security operations centre see, and when could it have known?</data></node>
